==French==

===Etymology===
*From Latin ''[[promittere]]''.

===Pronunciation===
*[[w:IPA|IPA]]: /pʁɔ.mɛtʁ/
*[[w:SAMPA|SAMPA]]: /pRO.mEtR/

===Verb===
'''promettre'''

# to [[promise]]
#: ''Je te '''promets''' que je te rendrai ton argent avant dimanche.'' (I promise I'll give you your money back before Sunday.)
# {{cattag|intransitive}} to be [[promising]], to be [[hopeful]].
#: ''C'est une athlète qui '''promet'''.'' (She is a promising athlete.)

===Related terms===
*[[promesse]]
*[[prometteur]]
*[[mettre]]

